  "claim": "borg_heal() skips healing when chance is below the band threshold, but the unique (-10), danger-at-or-above-HP (-75) and risky (+5) adjustments push chance the opposite way from their comments. In a native scenario a level-31 Warrior on 149/374 HP beside a fire giant (danger 192) with three Potions of Healing healed in 0 of 100 decisions and read Word of Recall; with the three signs flipped it heals in 100 of 100 and the real quaff restores it to 374 HP. Near a unique heals go 18 -> 32 of 100 (23 without a unique); a risky Borg goes 27 -> 20 (against 23 not risky). The ordinary-danger control is byte-identical.",
